  - https://www.huntress.com/blog/nightmare-eclipse-intrusion
  - https://www.hornetsecurity.com/en/blog/remcos-rat-attack-chain/
  - https://www.acronis.com/en/tru/posts/new-janaware-ransomware-targets-turkey-via-adwind-rat/
  - https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/tr-new-whitepaper-stealthy-bpfdoor-variants/
  - https://www.huntress.com/blog/rogue-screenconnect-social-engineering-tactics-2025
  - https://www.trellix.com/en-au/blogs/research/hiding-in-plain-sight-multi-actor-ahost-exe-attacks/
  - https://www.seqrite.com/blog/operation-nomad-leopard-targeted-spear-phishing-campaign-against-government-entities-in-afghanistan/
