    - https://www.securonix.com/blog/shroudedsleep-a-deep-dive-into-north-koreas-ongoing-campaign-against-southeast-asia/
    - https://blog.talosintelligence.com/emerging-interlock-ransomware/
    - https://blog.talosintelligence.com/new-pxa-stealer/
    - https://asec.ahnlab.com/en/85400/
    - https://www.securonix.com/blog/analyzing-obscurebat-threat-actors-lure-victims-into-executing-malicious-batch-scripts-to-deploy-stealthy-rootkits/
    - https://arcticwolf.com/resources/blog/unc6384-weaponizes-zdi-can-25373-vulnerability-to-deploy-plugx/
    - https://www.picussecurity.com/resource/blog/xhunt-apt-cyber-espionage-operations-targeting-kuwait-and-exchange-servers
    - https://www.malwarebytes.com/blog/threats/2025/11/we-opened-a-fake-invoice-and-fell-down-a-retro-xworm-shaped-wormhole
    - https://www.picussecurity.com/resource/blog/greencharlie-apt-irans-powershell-based-cyber-espionage-campaigns
    - https://asec.ahnlab.com/en/92160/
    - https://www.elastic.co/security-labs/mimicrat-custom-rat-mimics-c2-frameworks
tags:
    - attack.execution
    - attack.t1059.001
author: SOC Prime Team
logsource:
    category: process_creation
    product: windows
detection:
    selection:
        Image|endswith: '.exe' #windows bins scope.
        CommandLine|contains:
            - 'GetProcessById' #$a = [System.Diagnostics.Process]::GetProcessById(%PID%);$b...
            - 'WriteAllBytes' #https://cert.gov.ua/article/6281681; https://cert.gov.ua/article/6284949; https://www.lac.co.jp/lacwatch/report/20260604_004759.html; https://www.security.com/threat-intelligence/warlock-ransomware-critical-infrastructure; https://www.darktrace.com/blog/cikabika-bot-inside-a-discord-rat#cq=i1
            - 'Assembly.Load'
            - 'TCPClient'
            - 'ASCIIEncoding'
            - 'GetTypeFromCLSID'
            - 'System.Runtime.InteropServices.Marshal'
            - 'System.Windows.Forms.Clipboard'
            - 'System.Net.Sockets.TcpListener'
            - 'Reflection.Assembly' #https://www.elastic.co/security-labs/mimicrat-custom-rat-mimics-c2-frameworks; https://hunt.io/blog/philippine-government-employment-agency-records-stolen
            - 'Net.Sockets.SocketFlags'
            - 'System.Security.Cryptography' #https://cert.gov.ua/article/6282517
            - 'System.IO.File]'
            - 'ReadAllBytes' # powershell -WindowStyle Hidden Start-Process 'Presentation_Generale.pdf.pdf' ...[IO.File]::ReadAllBytes(...);$key=$data[239];$file=$env:TEMP+'\IfyuUapz.txt';...[IO.File]::WriteAllBytes($file, $xdata);cmd /c $file https://www.darktrace.com/blog/cikabika-bot-inside-a-discord-rat; https://strikeready.com/blog/cn-apt-targets-serbian-government/
            - 'ReadAllText' #https://cert.gov.ua/article/6284949; https://www.zscaler.com/blogs/security-research/memory-loader-drops-screenconnect; https://www.securonix.com/blog/deepdoor-python-backdoor-and-credential-stealer/
            - 'AssemblyBuilderAccess'
            - 'SuspendThread'
            - 'Runtime.InteropServices.DllImportAttribute'
            - 'Reflection.Emit.AssemblyBuilderAccess'
            - 'DownloadString' #https://asec.ahnlab.com/en/92160/; https://www.picussecurity.com/resource/blog/gamaredon-primitive-bear-apt-profile-and-mitre-attck-breakdown; https://socradar.io/blog/operation-conflict-compass-konni-ukraine-lnk-lure/; https://www.zscaler.com/blogs/security-research/seo-poisoning-campaign-delivers-new-armorsteal-malware
            - 'DownloadFile' #https://www.picussecurity.com/resource/blog/xhunt-apt-cyber-espionage-operations-targeting-kuwait-and-exchange-servers; https://blog.talosintelligence.com/uat-11795-deploys-novel-starland-rat-and-bespoke-wldr-c2-implant-in-financially-motivated-campaign/; https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2026/08/28/terminalfix-campaign-deploys-reverse-tunnel-through-multistage-intrusion/
            - 'DownloadData' #https://www.attackiq.com/2025/04/09/emulating-catb-ransomware/; https://www.pointwild.com/threat-intelligence/desckvb-rat-analysis-from-javascript-loader-to-fileless-net-rat/
            - 'WebRequest.' #request = HttpWebRequest.Create(uri) as HttpWebRequest;
            - 'GetRandomFileName' # Get random file/folder name.
    filters:
        - Image|endswith:
            - 'courgette64.exe'
            - 'Connect\DAAW.exe' # Checkpoint
        - ParentImage|endswith:
            - 'OInstallLite.exe' #"powershell" -command "& { (New-Object Net.WebClient).DownloadFile('http://officecdn.microsoft.com/pr/5030841d-c919-4594-8d2d-84ae4f96e58e/Office/Data/16.0.14332.20791/i641033.cab', 'C:\Users\admin\AppData\Local\Temp\over494851\i641033.cab') }"
            - 'ngentask.exe'
            - '\slack.exe' #Invoke-WebRequest -Uri https://slackb.com/error -Method POST...
            - 'protection\senseir.exe' #MDATP
            - 'system32\svchost.exe' #GPO Tasks with powershell job.
            - '\bin\runnerw64.exe' #phpstorm
            - '\cmd\git.exe' #git
            - 'SenseIR.exe' #Windows Defender
            - 'ptoneclk.exe' #Webex
            - 'ptupdate.exe' #Webex
            - 'CcmExec.exe' #CCM
        - CommandLine|contains:
            - 'officecdn.microsoft.com' #"powershell" -command "& { (New-Object Net.WebClient).DownloadFile('http://officecdn.microsoft.com/pr/5030841d-c919-4594-8d2d-84ae4f96e58e/Office/Data/v32.cab', 'C:\Users\xxx\AppData\Local\Temp\over106830\v32.cab') }"
            - 'ExternalComponents\Xls2PdfConverter' #ArtZvit
            - 'cru-inc.com' #https://it-forensik.fiw.hs-wismar.de/images/3/33/Write-blocking2022.pdf CRUWBlocker-1.2.1.2-(2018.09.04).tmp
            - '\MAS_'
            #- '\Program Files'
            - 'DellSupportAssistRemediationServiceInstaller' #dell stuff
            - 'SARemediation' #dell stuff
        - CommandLine|contains|all:
            - 'sysvol' #GPO scripts
            - 'Policies'
        - CommandLine|contains|all:
            - 'noroot' #/noroot /LegacyServiceBehavior
            - 'LegacyServiceBehavior'
            - 'ngen'
            - 'NativeImages'
            - 'Cryptography'
        - CommandLine|contains|all:
            - 'Defender' #Defender Advanced Threat Protection\DataCollection
            - 'Advanced'
            - 'Threat'
            - 'Protection'
            - 'DataCollection'
    condition: selection and not filters
falsepositives:
    - Administrative activity, GPO Tasks, etc.
level: medium
"#,
  // Powershell Script was Executed from Uncommon Directory (via cmdline)
  "5ed71dac-70f9-4f8d-9cbe-b2c2a6300271": r#"title: Powershell Script was Executed from Uncommon Directory (via cmdline)
id: 5ed71dac-70f9-4f8d-9cbe-b2c2a6300271
status: stable
author: SOC Prime Team
description: Adversaries may try to execute previously created malicious powershell script in order to perform malicious activity.
references:
  - https://www.sophos.com/en-us/blog/2607_agents_vs_telemetry
  - https://blogs.blackberry.com/en/2024/01/mexican-banks-and-cryptocurrency-platforms-targeted-with-allakore-rat
  - https://thehackernews.com/2026/01/russia-aligned-hackers-abuse-viber-to.html
  - https://www.pointwild.com/threat-intelligence/when-malware-talks-back/
tags:
  - attack.t1059.001
  - attack.execution
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    Image|endswith: 'powershell.exe'
    CommandLine|contains|all:
      - '.ps1'
  selection_dirs:
    CommandLine|contains:
      - 'AppData'
      - 'ProgramData'
      - 'Temp'
      - 'Local'
      - 'Public'
  filters:
    ParentImage|endswith:
      - 'senseir.exe' # Windows Defender
      - 'sensecm.exe' # Windows Defender
  condition: selection and selection_dirs
falsepositives:
  - Administrative scripts.
  - Administrative activity.
level: medium
"#,
  // LOLBAS WScript / Cscript with Powershell (via process_creation)
  "634171d9-675b-46a0-b75c-3c995ba86fdd": r#"title: LOLBAS WScript / Cscript with Powershell (via process_creation)
id: 634171d9-675b-46a0-b75c-3c995ba86fdd
status: stable
description: Identifies the employment of WScript as a living-off-the-land tactic in conjunction with PowerShell.
author: SOC Prime Team
references:
    - https://expel.com/blog/gootloaders-malformed-zip/
    - https://cert.gov.ua/article/6286219
    - https://www.trellix.com/blogs/research/xworm-v6-exploring-pivotal-plugins/
    - https://www.seqrite.com/blog/judicial-notification-phish-colombia-svg-asyncrat/
    - https://www.trendmicro.com/en_us/research/25/a/cve-2025-0411-ukrainian-organizations-targeted.html
    - https://cyble.com/blog/strela-stealer-targets-europe-stealthily-via-webdav/
    - https://www.welivesecurity.com/en/eset-research/cyberespionage-gamaredon-way-analysis-toolset-used-spy-ukraine-2022-2023/
    - https://twitter.com/doc_guard/status/1759572032503578664
    - https://www.mcafee.com/blogs/other-blogs/mcafee-labs/from-email-to-rat-deciphering-a-vbs-script-driven-campaign/
    - https://cert.gov.ua/article/6276988
    - https://www.mcafee.com/blogs/security-news/agent-teslas-unique-approach-vbs-and-steganography-for-delivery-and-intrusion/
    - https://www.zscaler.com/blogs/security-research/hibernating-qakbot-comprehensive-study-and-depth-campaign-analysis
    - https://cert.gov.ua/article/4818341
    - https://news.sophos.com/en-us/2023/04/13/tax-firms-targeted-by-precision-malware-attacks/
    - https://redcanary.com/blog/intelligence-insights-march-2023/
    - https://lolbas-project.github.io/lolbas/Binaries/Wscript/
    - https://threatresearch.ext.hp.com/raspberry-robin-now-spreading-through-windows-script-files/
    - https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/phantomvai-loader-delivers-infostealers/
    - https://www.recordedfuture.com/research/graycharlie-hijacks-law-firm-sites-suspected-supply-chain-attack
tags:
    - attack.defense_evasion
    - attack.execution
    - attack.t1216
    - attack.t1059.001 #Powershell
    - attack.t1059.005 #Visual Basic
logsource:
    category: process_creation
    product: windows
detection:
    selection_ws:
        ParentImage|endswith: 'wscript.exe'
        Image|endswith: 'powershell.exe' #https://cert.gov.ua/article/6286219
        #CommandLine|contains:
        #    - 'Unrestricted'
        #    - 'Webrequest'
        #    - 'iwr'
        #    - 'hidden'
        #    - 'bypass'
        #    - 'download'
        #    - 'http'
        #    - '[String]'
        #    - '-command'
    selection_cs:
        ParentImage|endswith: 'cscript.exe'
        Image|endswith: 'powershell.exe'
    filters:
        CommandLine|contains|all:
            - 'File' #"powershell.exe" -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -nologo -File C:\Windows\secops\secops.ps1
            - 'Windows'
            - 'secops.ps1'
    condition: (selection_ws and not filters) or selection_cs
falsepositives:
    - Administrative script files.
    - The reliance on the surrounding environment may necessitate the implementation of additional filtering measures to prevent false positives.
    - It is highly recommended to baseline your activity and tune out common business use cases.
level: high
"#,
  // Suspicious Windows DNS Query by Windows Script Host [wscript.exe] (via dns_query)
  "63f2ae8a-6912-4ea9-ad2c-369f4555a549": r#"title: Suspicious Windows DNS Query by Windows Script Host [wscript.exe] (via dns_query)
id: 63f2ae8a-6912-4ea9-ad2c-369f4555a549
description: Detects suspicious DNS queries made by Windows Script Host (wscript.exe).
status: stable
author: SOC Prime Team
references:
  - https://asec.ahnlab.com/en/94552/
  - https://www.trendmicro.com/en_au/research/20/l/investigating-the-gootkit-loader.html
  - https://www.trellix.com/blogs/research/malware-as-a-service-redefined-xworm-rat/
tags:
  - attack.execution
  - attack.t1059.005
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: dns_query
detection:
  selection:
    #EventCode: 22 # Optionally used to reduce SIEM resource consumption.
    Image|endswith: 'wscript.exe'
    DestinationHostname|contains: '.'
  condition: selection
falsepositives:
  - DNS queries by legitimate scripts.
level: medium
"#,
  // Possible Google Drive Phishing (via proxy)
  "64ec1ab8-162c-4281-b824-db3f69501cc8": r#"title: Possible Google Drive Phishing (via proxy)
id: 64ec1ab8-162c-4281-b824-db3f69501cc8
description: Adversaries can send specially crafted phishing links to files stored on Google Drive. If user clicks such link this will lead to direct file downloading.
status: stable
date: 2022/12/20
references:
    - https://sect.iij.ad.jp/blog/2026/06/continuous-evolution-of-kimjongrat-2026/
    - https://www.trendmicro.com/en_us/research/22/k/earth-preta-spear-phishing-governments-worldwide.html?utm_source=trendmicroresearch&utm_medium=smk&utm_campaign=earth-preta
    - https://www.mcafee.com/blogs/other-blogs/mcafee-labs/the-stealthy-stalker-remcos-rat/
    - https://www.elastic.co/security-labs/silentconnect-delivers-screenconnect
author: SOC Prime Team
tags:
    - attack.t1566.002
    - attack.initial_access
logsource:
    category: proxy
detection:
    selection:
        c-uri|contains|all:
            - 'drive.google.com'
            - 'uc?id'
            - 'export=download'
    condition: selection
falsepositives:
    - Legitimate Google Drive download links.
level: medium
"#,
