  - https://harfanglab.io/insidethelab/redkitten-ai-accelerated-campaign-targeting-iranian-protests/
  - https://www.pointwild.com/threat-intelligence/when-malware-talks-back
  - https://isc.sans.edu/diary/rss/32682
  - https://research.checkpoint.com/2026/amaranth-dragon-weaponizes-cve-2025-8088-for-targeted-espionage/
  - https://www.safebreach.com/blog/prince-of-persia-part-ii/
  - https://www.pointwild.com/threat-intelligence/when-malware-talks-back/
  - https://www.cyfirma.com/research/charliekirk-grabber-a-python-based-infostealer/
  - https://www.huntress.com/blog/openclaw-github-ghostsocks-infostealer
  - https://www.huntress.com/blog/daisy-chaining-rogue-rmm-tools
  - https://labs.k7computing.com/index.php/gibcrypto-the-destructive-ransomware-with-a-snake-keylogger-connection/
  - https://cofense.com/blog/livechat-abuse-how-phishers-are-exploiting-saas-support-tools-to-steal-sensitive-data
  - https://www.huntress.com/blog/w2-malvertising-to-kernel-mode-edr-kill
  - https://labs.k7computing.com/index.php/resoker-a-telegram-based-remote-access-trojan/
