    - https://www.picussecurity.com/resource/blog/cve-2025-53770-critical-unauthenticated-rce-in-microsoft-sharepoint
    - https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2025/04/09/stopping-attacks-against-on-premises-exchange-server-and-sharepoint-server-with-amsi/
    - https://thehackernews.com/2024/12/apache-tomcat-vulnerability-cve-2024.html
    - https://medium.com/@patelvidhi4288/deep-dive-poc-of-cve-2024-50379-exploit-tomcat-vulnerability-9-8-severity-776cfcfcf3ed
    - https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/cybersecurity-advisories/aa23-352a
    - https://www.infosecurity-magazine.com/news/signature-techniques-of-asian-apt/
    - https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/2023/11/06/etr-rapid7-observed-exploitation-of-atlassian-confluence-cve-2023-22518/
    - https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/agonizing-serpens-targets-israeli-tech-higher-ed-sectors/
    - https://www.cybereason.com/blog/research/operation-soft-cell-a-worldwide-campaign-against-telecommunications-providers
