    - https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/manic-menagerie-targets-web-hosting-and-it/
    - https://starlabs.sg/blog/2023/04-microsoft-exchange-powershell-remoting-deserialization-leading-to-rce-cve-2023-21707/
    - https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2022/12/12/iis-modules-the-evolution-of-web-shells-and-how-to-detect-them/
    - https://github.com/testanull/ProxyNotShell-PoC
    - https://twitter.com/wdormann/status/1593311129874403335
    - https://securitylabs.datadoghq.com/articles/openssl-november-1-vulnerabilities/
    - https://twitter.com/thezdi/status/1575871397867712512
    - https://www.gteltsc.vn/blog/warning-new-attack-campaign-utilized-a-new-0day-rce-vulnerability-on-microsoft-exchange-server-12715.html
    - https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/2022/09/29/suspected-post-authentication-zero-day-vulnerabilities-in-microsoft-exchange-server/
    - https://twitter.com/testanull/status/1542022704920170497
    - https://expel.io/blog/how-to-find-anomalous-process-relationships-threat-hunting/
    - https://asec.ahnlab.com/en/53132/
    - https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/threat-brief-moveit-cve-2023-34362/
    - https://asec.ahnlab.com/ko/64558/
    - https://asec.ahnlab.com/en/65390/
    - https://asec.ahnlab.com/en/66088/
    - https://www.trendmicro.com/en_us/research/25/a/investigating-a-web-shell-intrusion-with-trend-micro--managed-xd.html
